question:
Design a **text editor** class behind this interface, choosing a suitable data structure:

```
interface TextEditor {
    void insert(int offset, String text);
    void delete(int offset, int length);
    String getContents();
}
```

This was a 45-minute design problem in an on-campus SDE intern interview (CoderPad over Zoom). The interview was strictly time-bound; you had to implement each function with reasoning, and the code was judged on quality, complexity and object-oriented design. The interviewer was interactive and gave hints.
